# Local config and secrets with real, person/machine-specific values. These belong in
# <your workspace>/.weekly-515-reporting/ (outside this repo) — the patterns below are a safety net
# in case a copy is ever created here. Distribution is a git push to the GitHub marketplace, so
# anything committed ships to every colleague who installs the plugin.
shared/config.md
shared/credentials.md
.weekly-515-reporting/

# Packaged build artifacts (regenerate from source when cutting a release)
*.plugin
*.zip

# OS / editor junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
